  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&apos;&apos;EngageH2O&apos;&apos; Advancing the Green Agenda in Uzbekistan through Public Private Dialogue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Overall Objective: Empowering Communities and Strengthening CSOs for Sustainable Water Management through Capacity Building and Media Film Production .&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SO1:&lt;/strong&gt; Strengthening capacity of local CSOs to engage in youth inclusion and empowerment, gender equality and women empowerment, media literacy, environment and climate change (consolidation of actors)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SO2:&lt;/strong&gt; Strengthening capacities of local CSOs to engage in policy dialogue at national level and in dialogue, implementation and monitoring of national development programmes and plans s (arranging networking)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SO3:&lt;/strong&gt; To increase the capacity of civil society organisations to perform their role as independent development actors more effectively and to enhance efforts to promote a conducive environment for CSOs (building civil community capacity throw Public-Private Dialogue PPD)&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
